OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy bills forecast to go up by
OL,4,A#443 a year from January as UK
OL,5,Ainflation rate rises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new forecast, from energy consultancy
OL,8,FCornwall Insight, suggests energy bills
OL,9,Fcould go up 26% from January - that's
OL,10,F#443 a year
OL,12,FMillions of homes in England, Scotland
OL,13,Fand Wales are on tariffs affected by
OL,14,Fregulator Ofgem's price cap. Here's a
OL,15,Fquick guide to keeping your bills down
OL,16,Fin winter
OL,18,FMeanwhile, the UK's inflation rate rose
OL,19,Fagain in October, hitting 3.6% - the
OL,20,Ffourth consecutive monthly rise and the
OL,21,Fhighest rate in a year
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
