OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy bills forecast to go up by
OL,4,A#443 a year from January as UK
OL,5,Ainflation rate rises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Office for National Statistics says
OL,8,Fhigher fuel bills were "once again a
OL,9,Fmajor contributor" - but other things
OL,10,Falso increased in price, including
OL,11,Fcomputer software and cat food
OL,13,FThe government says wars in the Middle
OL,14,FEast and Ukraine have "pushed up costs
OL,15,Faround the world"
OL,17,FBut the shadow chancellor says the
OL,18,Fgovernment's decision to "hike taxes
OL,19,Fand employment costs" have contributed
OL,20,Fto the inflation increase
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
