OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy bills forecast to go up by
OL,4,A#443 a year from January as UK
OL,5,Ainflation rate rises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this month, the Bank raised
OL,8,Finterest rates to 4% in an effort to
OL,9,Fcurb inflation - it now says it will
OL,10,F"continue to set interest rates to make
OL,11,Fsure inflation returns to the 2%
OL,12,Ftarget"
